WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
Open Agent View starts in an isolated container and discovers the fixture sessions.

00:02.500 --> 00:05.000
The selection moves from a review-ready Claude task to a Codex approval request.

00:05.000 --> 00:08.500
The contextual keyboard guide opens and closes.

00:08.500 --> 00:11.500
The dashboard switches to directory grouping, returns to status grouping, and exits cleanly.
